# Say
#    pe http://example.com example.pdf
# to render the webpage as pdf using Minion Pro Regular
# as the main font. Change other aspects of default.css
# as needed. To upgrade percollate, say
#    npm install -g percollate
# Current version is 2.2.0
# Further info at https://github.com/danburzo/percollate/blob/main/README.md
